{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and use magical tarot cards to craft wares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck of tarot cards and use them to craft sellable wares. Increase item quality to sell items for more, but take care not to reduce integrity too much or your item might break! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/6f7228a3b12e4e73e8673c2c6dfd30bd.poster.avif?t=1757647019\" width=688 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/6f7228a3b12e4e73e8673c2c6dfd30bd.webm?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/6f7228a3b12e4e73e8673c2c6dfd30bd.mp4?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your turns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and plan every turn.  Freely move around, gather your ingredients and start smithing without expending any time. Then, when you're ready, skip forward however much time you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/ab183d6c517b481f2d3de3c6d70b45af.poster.avif?t=1757647019\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/ab183d6c517b481f2d3de3c6d70b45af.webm?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/ab183d6c517b481f2d3de3c6d70b45af.mp4?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather resources by night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather crafting materials, ingredients, gems, ores and much more at night. Use Vonna the Mage to gather what you'll need for the next day and venture deep into the caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/a9f9c941467efa086dee4218ed779a7b.poster.avif?t=1757647019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/a9f9c941467efa086dee4218ed779a7b.webm?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/a9f9c941467efa086dee4218ed779a7b.mp4?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three playable characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoro the Warrior, Zeras the Rogue and Vonna the Mage have completed a quest and have been rewarded with a blacksmithing shop. Simultaneously play as all three characters and decide how these adventurers will fare at running a smithy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master unique stations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To craft a sword, you must heat ore in the furnace, hammer it at the anvil, assemble it at the assembly table, and finally sharpen it at the sharpening wheel. Master all this while playing different tarot cards drawn at each station. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover secrets and more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the story told through different customers and characters you meet in the Duchy of Unzari. But take your time, chill, get cozy by the fire, and when you're ready, push ahead!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782130?t=1757647019","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782130?t=1757647019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/2cbf19c8de0e839e17d420a1f921a0bc343b4922/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757647019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/2cbf19c8de0e839e17d420a1f921a0bc343b4922/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757647019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and use magical tarot cards to craft wares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck of tarot cards and use them to craft sellable wares. Increase item quality to sell items for more, but take care not to reduce integrity too much or your item might break! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/6f7228a3b12e4e73e8673c2c6dfd30bd.poster.avif?t=1757647019\" width=688 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/6f7228a3b12e4e73e8673c2c6dfd30bd.webm?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/6f7228a3b12e4e73e8673c2c6dfd30bd.mp4?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your turns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and plan every turn.  Freely move around, gather your ingredients and start smithing without expending any time. Then, when you're ready, skip forward however much time you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/ab183d6c517b481f2d3de3c6d70b45af.poster.avif?t=1757647019\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/ab183d6c517b481f2d3de3c6d70b45af.webm?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/ab183d6c517b481f2d3de3c6d70b45af.mp4?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather resources by night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather crafting materials, ingredients, gems, ores and much more at night. Use Vonna the Mage to gather what you'll need for the next day and venture deep into the caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/a9f9c941467efa086dee4218ed779a7b.poster.avif?t=1757647019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/a9f9c941467efa086dee4218ed779a7b.webm?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/extras/a9f9c941467efa086dee4218ed779a7b.mp4?t=1757647019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three playable characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoro the Warrior, Zeras the Rogue and Vonna the Mage have completed a quest and have been rewarded with a blacksmithing shop. Simultaneously play as all three characters and decide how these adventurers will fare at running a smithy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master unique stations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To craft a sword, you must heat ore in the furnace, hammer it at the anvil, assemble it at the assembly table, and finally sharpen it at the sharpening wheel. Master all this while playing different tarot cards drawn at each station. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover secrets and more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the story told through different customers and characters you meet in the Duchy of Unzari. But take your time, chill, get cozy by the fire, and when you're ready, push ahead!</p>","developers":["Galaxy Bunny Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782130/e8578658359417cf3f958d056208d1091bf4d49e/header.jpg?t=1757647019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3782130/1525946716/be03fec97687342f53629c0506b3fa0187cb6b11/1750374678/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749315356","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3782130/1525946716/be03fec97687342f53629c0506b3fa0187cb6b11/1750374678/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749315356","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3782130/1525946716/be03fec97687342f53629c0506b3fa0187cb6b11/1750374678/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749315356","id":257150780,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150780/movie480.mp4?t=1749315356","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150780/movie_max.mp4?t=1749315356"},"name":"Smithy By Day Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150780/471eeffe32ef1761357595f8f8e859690e0265a7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749315356","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150780/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749315356","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150780/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749315356"}}],"name":"Smithy By Day","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I5 4690 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<b